---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <img class="about-photo" src="/photo.jpg" width="480" height="600"
         alt="Zeeshan Arshad, SEO specialist and CMS/AI developer based in Islamabad, Pakistan" loading="lazy" />
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2 class="h-sec">SEO specialist first, developer by craft</h2>
      <p>I've spent 4+ years helping healthcare, e-commerce, and service businesses grow their organic visibility, and increasingly, their visibility inside AI search. What sets me apart is that I don't just recommend SEO changes, I can build them: new pages, schema, performance fixes, and full sites.</p>
      <p>My work spans the full SEO picture, technical, on-page, content, and off-page, plus AEO/GEO, the emerging practice of optimizing so AI models understand, trust, and recommend a site. On the build side I work across WordPress, WooCommerce, Shopify, Webflow, and Wix, with WordPress as my core.</p>
      <div class="chips">
        {['Technical SEO','AI SEO / AEO / GEO','WordPress','WooCommerce','Core Web Vitals','AI Automation'].map(c => <span class="tag">{c}</span>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
